                                     174A  3144 ;	code up to the { again } is executed and then a branch back to
                                     174A  3145 ;	{ repeat } is done.  If the top of the stack is false, execution jumps
                                     174A  3146 ;	to the code after the { again }.
                                     174A  3147 ;---
